      "                                    \n     ⢀⡤⠤⢤⡀  ⢠⠴⠶⠦⣄ ⢀⡴⠒⠒⠦⡀●⢀⠔⠚⠛⠲⣄     \n    ⢠⠋⢀⣤⡀⠘⡆⢰⠃⢀⣤⡄⠈⡇⡾·⣰⣶·⢸·⣾·⢴⣶·⢸⠄    \n    ⠘⣄⠈⠛⠃⢠⠇⠘⣆·⠙⠁⣠⠇⠹⣄⠈⠉⢀⡼·⠘⣄⡈⠁⣀⠞··   \n     ⠈⠓⢒⠒⠁··⠈⢙⣒⣋⠁··⠈⣉⣋⣉·· ⢀⣩⠭⣅⡀·    \n     ⡴⠋⠉⠉⠳⡄ ⡴⠉⢀⠈⠙⡆⢠⠋·⣀⠈⠳⡀⢰⠋⢀⣀⡀⠹⡄    \n    ⠐⡇·⢿⡷·⣿⠐⡇·⢿⠿·⡽⢸⡀⠘⠿⠃⢀⠇⢸⡀⠘⠟⠃⢠⠇·   \n     ⠑⢤⣀⣀⡴⠃·⠙⠦⣤⡤⠔⠁·⠑⠦⠤⠴⠋··⠙⠲⠶⠖⠋··   \n      ······ ······ ·····  ·····    \n                                    ",
      "                                    \n     ⢀⡤⠤⢤⡀  ⣠⠴⠶⠦⣄ ⢀⡴⠒⠒⠢⡄ ⢀⠔⠚⠛⠲⣄     \n    ⢠⠋⢀⣤⡀⠘⡆⢰⠃⢀⣤⡄⠈⡇⡾·⣰⣶·⢸·⣾·⢴⣶·⢸⠄    \n    ⠘⣄⠈⠛⠃⢠⠇⠘⣆·⠙⠁⣠⠇⠹⣄⠈⠉⢀⡼·⠘⢄⡀⠁⣀⠞··   \n     ⠈⠓⢒⠚⠁··⠈⢙⣒⣋⠁··⠈⣉⣉⣉·· ⢀⣩⠭⣅⡀·    \n     ⡴⠋⠉⠉⠳⡄ ⡴⠉⢀⠈⠙⡆⢠⠋·⣀⠈⠱⡀⢰⠋⢀⣀⡀⠹⡄    \n    ⠰⡇·⢿⡷·⣿⠐⡇·⢿⠿·⡽⢸⡀⠘⠿⠃⢀⠇⢸⡀⠘⠛⠃⢠⠇·   \n     ⠑⢤⣀⣀⠴⠃·⠙⠦⣤⡤⠔⠁·⠑⠦⠤⠴⠋··⠙⠲⠶⠖⠋··   \n      ······ ······ ·····  ·····    \n                                    ",
      "                                    \n     ⢀⡤⠤⢤⡀  ⣠⠴⠖⠦⣄ ⢀⡴⠒⠒⠢⡄ ⢀⠔⠚⠛⠲⣄     \n    ⢰⠃⢀⣤⡀⠘⡆⢰⠃⢀⣤⡄⠈⡇⡾·⣰⣶·⢸⡀⣾·⢰⣶⠄⢸⡄    \n    ⠸⡄⠈⠛⠃⢠⠇⠘⣆·⠙⠁⣠⠇⠹⣄⠈⠉⢀⡼·⠘⢄⡀⠁⣀⠞··   \n     ⠈⠓⢒⠚⠁··⠈⢙⣒⣋⠁··⠈⣉⣉⣉·· ⢀⣩⠭⣅⡀·    \n     ⡴⠋⠉⠉⠳⡄ ⡴⠉⢀⠈⠙⡆⢠⠋·⣀⠈⠱⡀⢰⠋⢀⣀⡀⠹⡄    \n    ⠰⡇·⣿⡷·⡿⠐⡇·⠿⠿·⡽⢸⡀⠘⠿⠃⢀⠇⠸⡀⠘⠛⠃⢠⠇·   \n     ⠱⢤⣀⣀⠴⠃·⠙⠦⣤⡤⠔⠁·⠑⠦⠤⠴⠋··⠙⠲⠶⠖⠋··   \n      ······ ······ ·····  ·····    \n                                    ",
